---
const { href = '/research' } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="banner" id="academics">
  <img src="/Photos/nc-at-10265-new-gigapixel-low resolution v2-2x-faceai v2.jpeg" alt="An NC A&T chemistry student working at the lab bench in the New Science Building" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
  <div class="wrap inner">
    <span class="eyebrow" style="color:#ffe3a3">Facilities &amp; Instrumentation</span>
    <h2 style="margin-top:16px">Where the work happens.</h2>
    <p>Modern teaching labs and shared instrumentation — built for hands-on chemistry from year one.</p>
    <a class="btn" href={href}>Tour facilities &amp; instrumentation</a>
  </div>
  <span class="cap">Inside our teaching &amp; research labs</span>
</div>
